<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>Nothing in this chapter shall be construed to revoke, modify, or alter in any manner any statutory provision or any judicial decision which (a)<span class="EnSpace"/>authorizes an individual to gain access to any law enforcement record, or (b)<span class="EnSpace"/>authorizes discovery in criminal or civil litigation.</p></caml:Content>